# The Tor framework is a release asset, not a repository file — it is 15 MB
# slimmed and 335 MB upstream. `App/Vendor/Tor/slim-tor.sh` produces it.
App/Vendor/Tor/tor.xcframework/
App/Vendor/Tor/*.zip
docs/__pycache__/

# Ruffle's web build is fetched by Sources/LatheSWFRender/fetch-upstream.sh and
# is never committed — see Sources/LatheSWFRender/VENDORING.md. The directory
# itself is tracked through its PLACEHOLDER.md.
Sources/LatheSWFRender/RenderHost/ruffle/*
!Sources/LatheSWFRender/RenderHost/ruffle/PLACEHOLDER.md
